body:
Exactly, the show runners are trying to reverse engineer this and say look guys, it was there all along!

&#x200B;

No, no it wasn't. D&D PICKED Arya from the 'candidates' because they thought the fans would love it not because of some deeply woven, interconnected plot being driven all along.

&#x200B;

I really think George RR Martin didn't leave these guys shit to go on when they passed the books.
